$DATUM 1,3-Bis(4-(4-aminophenylthio)benzamido)benzene (2a) and 4,
4′-Bis(4-(4-aminophenylthio)benzamido)diphenyl sulfone (2b) [23] Then 1
was converted to 2 through nucleophilic etherification of
4-aminobenzenethiol in DMF at 155 °C kept for 4 h as shown in Fig. 2.
2a-2b was purified with water and methanol. Then they were recrystallized
from the mixture of water and DMF (1:1). That afforded 2a-2b as yellow
sheet crystal. 2a Yield: 83.4%. m.p.: 157-159 °C, m/z(M+): 561.35.
